    "work_id": "anf-works/pseudo-justin-discourse-to-the-greeks",
    "canonical_ref": "PsJust.OrGr.iii.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "which it is not lawful to utter, killed Achelous, and the guest-slaying Busiris), and crossed the mountains that he might get water which gave forth an articulate speech, as the story goes:",
