    "canonical_ref": "PsJust.OrGr.iii.s7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And at last, not being able to put off the tunic of Nessus, himself kindling his own funeral pile, so he died.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 200,
    "date_range": [
