    "work_id": "anf-works/pseudo-justin-discourse-to-the-greeks",
    "canonical_ref": "PsJust.OrGr.v.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And being set free from the ills in which it was sunk up to the neck, it returns to Him who made it. For it is fit that it be restored to that state whence it departed, whence every soul was or is.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
